# STATION 1: choices, hubs, Continue, Leave, guarded and disabled options.
npc: @test_basics
title: Station 1 - Basics
speaker: Tester

== start
TEST 1: Basics. This line and the choices below should appear together, with no Continue button.
-> A. Two lines in a row (expect a Continue button between them)
    First line. You should see a Continue button now.
    Second line. After this you should be back at the station menu.
-> B. Hidden option (this option is only visible after you pick C)  <<if $saw_c>>
    Correct: you saw this because you picked C earlier.
-> C. Reveal option B
    Option B should now be visible in the menu.
    <<set $saw_c = true>>
-> D. Disabled option: should be greyed and do nothing when clicked <<show if false>>
    You should never see this text.
-> E. Jump to another node
    <<jump elsewhere>>
-> F. Leave (this should close the window after one line)
    Farewell. A single Leave button should be showing, no Continue.
    <<end>>

